39752805693](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39752805693)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39752805729](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39752805729)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
